From 54502377c6ab759517692223fbd2459dd5582a79 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Martin Mirchev <mmirchev@comp.nus.edu.sg>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 19:03:15 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] avutil/iamf: fix child_class_iterate callbacks

The child_class_iterate callbacks of AVIAMFAudioElement,
AVIAMFSubmixElement and AVIAMFMixPresentation returned their single
child class only for a non-zero iteration state. The state starts at
zero, so they never returned anything, and av_opt_child_class_iterate()
and av_opt_find2() with AV_OPT_SEARCH_CHILDREN | AV_OPT_SEARCH_FAKE_OBJ
could not reach the AVIAMFLayer, AVIAMFParamDefinition and AVIAMFSubmix
options from these classes.

Return the child class on the first call instead.

Signed-off-by: Martin Mirchev <mmirchev@comp.nus.edu.sg>
(cherry picked from commit 54502377c6ab759517692223fbd2459dd5582a79)
---
 libavutil/iamf.c | 6 +++---
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/libavutil/iamf.c b/libavutil/iamf.c
index 76707563cbb..66c6f350f79 100644
--- a/libavutil/iamf.c
+++ b/libavutil/iamf.c
@@ -300,7 +300,7 @@ static const AVClass *audio_element_child_iterate(void **opaque)
     uintptr_t i = (uintptr_t)*opaque;
     const AVClass *ret = NULL;
 
-    if (i)
+    if (!i)
         ret = &layer_class;
 
     if (ret)
@@ -387,7 +387,7 @@ static const AVClass *submix_element_child_iterate(void **opaque)
     uintptr_t i = (uintptr_t)*opaque;
     const AVClass *ret = NULL;
 
-    if (i)
+    if (!i)
         ret = &param_definition_class;
 
     if (ret)
@@ -498,7 +498,7 @@ static const AVClass *mix_presentation_child_iterate(void **opaque)
     uintptr_t i = (uintptr_t)*opaque;
     const AVClass *ret = NULL;
 
-    if (i)
+    if (!i)
         ret = &submix_class;
 
     if (ret)
-- 
